{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14408","headline":"九日与敬处士左学士同赋采菊上东山便爲首句 · 戴叔伦","name":"九日与敬处士左学士同赋采菊上东山便爲首句","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"采菊上东山，山高路非远。\n江湖乍辽敻，城郭亦在眼。\n昼日市井喧，闰年禾稼晚。\n开尊会佳客，长啸临绝巘。\n戏鹤唳且闲，断云轻不卷。\n乡心各万里，醉话时一展。\n乔木列遥天，残阳贯平坂。\n徒忧征车重，自笑谋虑浅。\n却顾郡斋中，寄傲与君同。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"戴叔伦","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_14408.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14408","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}